[17.615, "o", "    Create a support-triage queue in app.py: classify a message and flag urgent ones.\r\n"]
[17.675, "o", "\u001b[1m  assistant:\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  (claude-opus-4-8)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.735, "o", "    \u001b[2m[thinking] \u001b[0mKeep it minimal: a keyword classifier with an urgent flag, one handle().\r\n"]
[17.795, "o", "    I'll add a small triage function.\r\n"]
[17.855, "o", "    \u001b[36m[tool_use Write] \u001b[0m{\"content\": \"def handle(msg):\\n    return classify(msg)  # -> {queue, urgent}\\n\", \"file_path\": \"app.py\"}\r\n"]
